---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const APP_URL = "https://rental-recourse.vercel.app";
---

<footer
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--color-ink)] text-[color:var(--color-paper)] mt-24 grain"
>
  <div class="relative max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-10">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span
            class="inline-grid place-items-center size-8 rounded-full border border-[color:var(--color-ochre)] text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] font-display text-[17px] leading-none"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >R</span>
          <span class="font-display text-2xl">Recourse</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-[1.15] max-w-md">
          A marketplace of legal advisors for Indian tenants. Starting with the
          <span class="italic text-[color:var(--color-ochre)]">stamped notice</span>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[13px] text-[color:var(--color-paper-muted)] max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          Recourse is a service by an independent operator. It is not a law
          firm. Notices are drafted from your inputs and stamped by
          Bar Council&ndash;enrolled advocates on our panel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-paper">The product</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px]">
          <li><a href="/notice/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">The Notice</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${APP_URL}/intake`} class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">Draft a notice</a></li>
          <li><a href="/how-it-works/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">How it works</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-paper">Marketplace</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px]">
          <li><a href="/advisors/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">Advisors</a></li>
          <li><a href="/advisors/#for-advocates" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">For advocates</a></li>
          <li><a href="/advisors/#waitlist" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">Join waitlist</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-paper">The firm</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px]">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">Privacy &amp; disclaimer</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:hello@myrecourse.in" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ochre)] transition-colors">hello@myrecourse.in</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-[color:var(--color-hairline-dark)] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--color-paper-muted)] font-mono">
      <span>&copy; {year} Recourse &middot; Est. MMXXVI</span>
      <span>Not a law firm. Not legal advice. See <a href="/privacy/" class="underline">disclaimer</a>.</span>
      <span>Made in India</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
